{"id":"reference/unreachable","kind":"langref","title":"unreachable","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#unreachable","file":"reference/unreachable.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"unreachable","text":"unreachable"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Basics","text":"基础"},{"depth":3,"slug":"At-Compile-Time","text":"编译时"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"unreachable\" class=\"chapter-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/unreachable/#unreachable\">unreachable</a></h2>\n\n      <p>在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#debug\">debug</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#safe\">safe</a> 模式下，<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code> 会生成对 <code>panic</code> 的调用，并传入消息 <code>reached unreachable code</code>。</p>\n      <p>在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#fast\">fast</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#small\">small</a> 模式下，优化器会利用永远不会执行到 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code> 代码这一假设进行优化。</p>\n      <h3 id=\"Basics\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/unreachable/#Basics\">基础</a></h3>\n\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test_unreachable.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// unreachable 用于断言控制流永远不会到达</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 某个特定位置：</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"basic math\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">unreachable</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test test_unreachable.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1/1 test_unreachable.test.basic math...OK</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">All 1 tests passed.</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <p>实际上，<code>std.debug.assert</code> 就是这样实现的：</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test_assertion_failure.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// std.debug.assert 就是这样实现的</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">ok</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">ok</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">unreachable</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 断言失败</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 此测试会失败，因为执行到了 unreachable。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"this will fail\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">false</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test test_assertion_failure.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1/1 test_assertion_failure.test.this will fail...thread 708684 panic: reached unreachable code</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_assertion_failure.zig:3:14: 0x124c5a9 in assert (test_assertion_failure.zig)</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">if (!ok) unreachable; // assertion failure</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">             </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_assertion_failure.zig:8:11: 0x124c57e in test.this will fail (test_assertion_failure.zig)</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">assert(false);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">          </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:295:25: 0x1200951 in mainTerminal (test_runner.zig)</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">if (test_fn.func()) |_| {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">                        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:74:28: 0x1200132 in main (test_runner.zig)</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">return mainTerminal(init);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">                           </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:789:88: 0x11fc8cf in callMain (std.zig)</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">if (fn_info.param_types[0].? == std.process.Init.Minimal) return wrapMain(root.main(.{</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">                                                                                       </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:248:5: 0x11fc2b1 in _start (std.zig)</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">asm volatile (switch (native_arch) {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">error: the following test command terminated with signal ABRT:</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/.zig-cache/o/fd00e88bd13ffee28e46bc2aecbfd750/test --seed=0x3b92b89e</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"At-Compile-Time\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/unreachable/#At-Compile-Time\">编译时</a></h3>\n\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test_comptime_unreachable.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">assert</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">debug</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">assert</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"type of unreachable\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">comptime</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// unreachable 的类型是 noreturn。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 但这个断言仍然无法编译，因为</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 编译时执行 unreachable 表达式会产生编译错误。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@TypeOf</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">unreachable</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">noreturn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test test_comptime_unreachable.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_comptime_unreachable.zig:10:16: error: unreachable code</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">assert(@TypeOf(unreachable) == noreturn);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">               </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_comptime_unreachable.zig:10:24: note: control flow is diverted here</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">assert(@TypeOf(unreachable) == noreturn);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">                       </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^~~~~~~~~~~</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Test/#Zig-Test\">Zig 测试</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#Optimization-Mode\">优化模式</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">comptime</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      \n      ","translation":{"total":21,"translated":21}}
